    "The ordinary cohort has two passing negative/cleanup scenarios and sixteen failures; a nonzero configure exit in the verification-failure scenario is expected and is not independently a defect.",
    "Both corrected-source wire reports still observe the effective-firewall refusal literal during configuration. The numeric Full compatibility correction does not resolve the native refusal in this cohort.",
